---
const COLORS = [
  ['Cokelat', '#8b5e3c'],
  ['Hijau sage', '#5f7a61'],
  ['Biru dusty', '#4a6785'],
  ['Rose', '#b5586b'],
  ['Arang', '#3a3a3a'],
  ['Emas', '#a8873a'],
];

const PATTERNS = [
  ['none', 'Tanpa pola'],
  ['floral', 'Bunga'],
  ['leaf', 'Daun'],
  ['kawung', 'Kawung (batik)'],
  ['dots', 'Titik'],
  ['waves', 'Gelombang'],
];
---
<div class="space-y-6">
  <div>
    <label for="f-theme-color" class="block text-sm font-medium">Warna utama</label>
    <div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
      <input id="f-theme-color" type="color" data-bind="theme.primaryColor"
        class="h-9 w-14 cursor-pointer rounded border p-0.5" />
      {COLORS.map(([name, value]) => (
        <button type="button" data-color-preset={value} title={name} aria-label={name}
          class="h-7 w-7 rounded-full border" style={`background:${value}`}></button>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">
      Dipakai untuk judul, garis, tombol, dan pola. Warna yang terlalu terang ditolak agar teks putih tetap terbaca.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-red-600" data-error-for="theme.primaryColor"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-2">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium">Pola latar</p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      {PATTERNS.map(([kind, label]) => (
        <button type="button" data-pattern-pick={kind} title={label} aria-label={label}
          class="h-14 w-14 overflow-hidden rounded border bg-stone-50 p-0.5">
          {kind === 'none' ? (
            <span class="grid h-full place-items-center text-xs text-gray-400">Tanpa</span>
          ) : (
            <span class="pattern-preview" data-pattern-kind={kind}></span>
          )}
        </button>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div>
      <label for="f-pattern-opacity" class="block text-xs text-gray-600">Ketebalan pola</label>
      <input id="f-pattern-opacity" type="range" min="5" max="40" step="1"
        data-bind="theme.pattern.opacity" data-type="number" class="w-full" />
      <p class="text-sm text-red-600" data-error-for="theme.pattern.opacity"></p>
    </div>

    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
      <input type="checkbox" data-bind="theme.pattern.all" /> Terapkan ke semua section
    </label>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
      Bila dimatikan, pilih section mana saja yang berpola lewat "Gaya section" di tiap section.
      Warna pola mengikuti warna utama.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-red-600" data-error-for="theme.pattern.kind"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-2">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium">Animasi</p>
    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
      <input type="checkbox" data-bind="theme.animation.enabled" /> Aktifkan animasi fade-in saat digulir
    </label>
    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
      <input type="checkbox" data-bind="theme.animation.all" /> Terapkan ke semua section
    </label>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
      Bawaan: mati. Animasi otomatis tidak dijalankan untuk pengunjung yang memilih "kurangi gerakan" di perangkatnya.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>